    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "primary_message": "Set glass right side up and fill with lime juice. Add a pinch or two of salt, fill glass with ice, and top with beer. Stir gently if you want to mix it up a bit. Serve with remaining beer, topping up as you drink.",
